"FROM: Larry Landborn, Unit B11\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Noise complaint\n"
"\n"
"  Hello.  I am once again requesting your help with my neighbor in B10.  There are loud sounds from all times of day.  She claims her grandkids are visiting but the noises have been non-stop for weeks!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
