"FROM: Sandra Shells, Unit B06\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Horrible smell\n"
"\n"
"  There's a bad smell coming from unit B07.  Please look into it.  Thanks."
msgstr ""

